  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/285e6d569d1a476c6b198a6b8c1eb175571651ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>Portfolio 是一個小型模組與資料包，為遊戲新增了一系列由藝術家 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fyptsh.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yapetto</a></span> 創作的全新畫作。這些畫作包括《塞納河之晨》、《正義》與《冥界》等作品。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此為 Portfolio 的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>模組版本</strong></span>，若您想下載資料包版本，請<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/portfolio\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處</a></span>前往資料包頁面。</p><h3>Portfolio 的不同畫作目錄</h3><p>靜物畫目錄 - 1.0 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d2f8f2dbc290f509a929ee382f93b6185894bb1c.png\"></div><p>虛空莊園目錄 - 1.1 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a088b34631297e611524006dd859f600fb67e4ce.png\"></div><p>死亡目錄 - 1.2 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eecdb51577c9fcf86767fe82e9b5d5349927b08b.png\"></div><p>拉娜目錄 - 1.3 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4af9c8dbb3a374a9018853f2285e7b844314ed6d.png\"></div><p>遙遠之地目錄 - 1.3.5 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/136c997b05135cad0e425556bd6d05bc8db81faa.png\"></div><p>錨定目錄 - 1.4 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aae2bb2faf08324cbfdc23a6572b5e22aebbdd9f.png\"></div><p>巨人目錄 - 1.5 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/800fb441ad894cc87953fcb35678859a72ae93f1.png\"></div><p>元素目錄 - 1.5 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/61fa1b2f6ea7171c3a02bd16ff83affc4c3ae5a9.png\"></div><p>雲杜鵑目錄 - 1.5.5 </p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b03c9b68ed15bf04b645c12a887aaf74d42dc1db.png\"></div>",
